OL,3,GNEWSAPolice drone crash could have
OL,4,Acaused fatal injuries
OL,5,
OL,6,FA malfunctioning drone's fall to earth
OL,7,Fduring a police search could have
OL,8,Fkilled someone, a report has said.
OL,10,FThe DJI M300 drone was one of two
OL,11,Fdeployed over West Bridgford by
OL,12,FNottinghamshire Police at 03:20 BST on
OL,13,F1 June to hunt for suspects.
OL,15,FBut minutes after launching from the
OL,16,FAsda car park, the unmanned aircraft
OL,17,Fhad an issue with one of its four motor
OL,18,Farms and lost control, falling 380ft
OL,19,Fand crashing onto Kingswood Road.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
