OL,3,GNEWSAPolice drone crash could have
OL,4,Acaused fatal injuries
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Air Accident Investigation Branch
OL,7,F(AAIB) concluded that while no injuries
OL,8,Fwere caused, the speed of the crash
OL,9,Fcould have caused fatal injuries, while
OL,10,Fthe remote pilot had not carried out
OL,11,Fany pre-flight checks or watched
OL,12,Ftake-off on their body-worn video as
OL,13,Frecommended.
